# senthym
===
 Senthym is a Spotify-style music player for Linux, Windows and macOS. Search and stream songs from YouTube Music, Deezer and SoundCloud with no ads, accounts or API keys. It plays your own files, shows synced lyrics and official music videos up to 1080p, and has crossfade. Built with Rust. Your Music. Your Freedom..
